From 473b3ba430c01a865faad165f4ef16226d564371 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:59:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: wave5: propagate FIO and reset sequencing failures

Poll indirect bus status until idle using a shared deadline, check FIO write acknowledgments, and leave stop requests asserted when draining or resetting fails. Report firmware rejection during initialization and sleep/wake instead of discarding its failure code.

Exercise the actual polling, reset, and sleep/wake functions with scripted MMIO faults and virtual time. Runtime job cancellation, DMA quarantine, and multi-instance recovery remain separate work.
---
 .../platform/chips-media/wave5/test_reset.py  | 315 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../platform/chips-media/wave5/wave5-hw.c     | 192 +++++++----
 2 files changed, 442 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)
